{"turn_id": "d13-t1", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "combined_resources", "text": "构建该 polyglot 语义角色标注器时，作者合并了 CoNLL 2009 共享任务中一对语言的资源。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "conll2009_languages", "text": "系统在 CoNLL-2009 共享任务的语义角色标注部分进行评估，覆盖全部七种语言：加泰罗尼亚语、汉语、捷克语、英语、德语、日语和西班牙语。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "作者为 CoNLL 2009 数据集中的每种语言训练多个解析器：一个传统的单语版本，以及额外纳入该数据集英语部分监督信息的若干变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "simple_data_combination", "text": "作者发现，即使只是简单地组合数据，其效果也与更复杂的 polyglot 训练方式相当。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "method_summary", "text": "作者描述的 polyglot SRL 训练方法是：使用多语言词向量，并合并跨语言的训练数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "no_parallel_needed", "text": "该方法无需跨语言对齐、共享标注或平行数据即可实现跨语言共享；摘要指出，即使没有平行数据且各语言标注存在差异，该做法仍提升了多种语言的 SRL 性能。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d13-t2", "session_id": "d13", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "resource_combination", "text": "论文在 CoNLL 2009 共享任务中把一对语言的资源组合起来，构建 polyglot 语义角色标注器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "english_supervision", "text": "论文为 CoNLL 2009 中的每种语言训练传统单语版本，以及额外引入数据集英语部分监督的变体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "first_multilingual_srl", "text": "作者称这是首个结合多个语言监督的多语种 SRL 方法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "simple_combination_effective", "text": "论文发现，即使只是简单地组合数据，其效果也与更复杂的 polyglot 训练方式相当。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "no_parallel_data", "text": "尽管缺少平行数据，且各语言标注不一致，该方法在多种语言上仍优于单语基线。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}]}, {"key": "sharing_without_alignment", "text": "作者指出，跨语言共享统计强度不依赖标注约定上的显式对齐，可以仅通过参数共享实现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-ab37506cf0e270f6ab4a5722"}]}, {"key": "straightforward_method", "text": "结论中描述的方法是使用多语词向量并跨语言组合训练数据，这允许在没有跨语言对齐、共享标注或平行数据的情况下进行共享。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-f04cb29df42fdbc211d852cf"}]}, {"key": "low_resource_advantage", "text": "分析显示 polyglot 模型在低资源设置中具有优势；训练样本最少的语言（德语、日语、加泰罗尼亚语）提升最大。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-8b21bd8c4c41f76753d2758d"}, {"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-bb02e8199a80bde6c03e4d79"}]}, {"key": "simple_polyglot_results", "text": "简单的 polyglot 训练优于单语训练，但捷克语是例外，没有观察到性能变化。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-bb02e8199a80bde6c03e4d79"}]}, {"key": "label_space_differs", "text": "CoNLL 2009 的语义标签空间完全是语言特定的：英语使用 PropBank 角色标签，捷克语和日语各有独特的论元标签集，且大多与英语或彼此没有明确对应。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1805.11598", "chunk_id": "c-d2d99eebfd526f64d0796b70"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d13-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
